Subject: [PATCH 1/5] app: e2e-tests: Cover production frontend runtime

Establish a builder-neutral browser contract before changing the default
frontend toolchain. Build the production frontend and real backend, then
launch Electron against the generated files.

Reject broken scripts, styles, fonts, images, renderer exceptions, and
missing plugin globals. Navigate to a lazy route so post-start chunks are
covered in addition to initial rendering.
---
