Subject: [PATCH 2/5] backend: cmd: Cover runtime base rewriting

Extend the existing on-disk SPA rewrite fixture before changing frontend
builders. Verify that a relative runtime base marker becomes `/` at the
root and the configured prefix for non-root deployments.

This contract passes with the existing Vite build and protects the static
directory path used by container deployments.
